    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Intuitive\nNew Age Painter",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Intuitive New Age Painter",
          "href": "http://www.koert.com/work/newage/",
          "external": true
        }
      ],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Playing\nwith color is fun and relaxing. You can make your own intuitive\npainting in our interactive painter. You don't have to click or\nselect color to get beautiful results. Just move the mouse! It\nis so easy, even a monkey could do it. All you need is a shockwave\nplugin and a 24 bit screendepth.\n\nHave fun!\n\nHint: try painting with your eyes closed. You will get the most\nbeautiful results.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Painter",
      "links": [],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Cf. Jeffrey Sutton: Painter\nCreativity Digital Artist's Handbook",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Painter Creativity Digital Artist's Handbook",
          "href": "http://www.portrayals.com/paintercreativity.html",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"The goal of this book is for\nyou to realize your full creative potential and express yourself\nin your art with soul and passion. You will learn how to use the\namazing paint program Painter 7 to create expressive portraits,\ntransform photographs, and produce evocative collage and painterly\nanimations.\"\n\n\n\nE.g.: \"Loose\nGestural Paint Splash Strokes a la Jackson Pollock.\"",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Loose Gestural Paint Splash Strokes a la Jackson Pollock.",
          "href": "http://www.portrayals.com/tippollock.html",
          "external": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
