    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Signwave\nAuto-Illustrator",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Signwave Auto-Illustrator",
          "href": "http://www.auto-illustrator.com/",
          "external": true
        }
      ],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Signwave Auto-Illustrator is an experimental,\nsemi-autonomous, generative software artwork and a fully functional\nvector graphic design application to sit alongside your existing\nprofessional graphic design utilities. Use it to explore a wide\nrange of generative and procedural techniques in the production\nof your own graphic designs.\"",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Signwave\nAutoshop",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Signwave Autoshop",
          "href": "http://www.signwave.co.uk/go/products/autoshop",
          "external": true
        }
      ],
      "level": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\"Autoshop takes the clean-cut,\nproductive interface of a well-known commercial software product\n(Adobe® Photoshop® in case you hadn't noticed) and imbues\nit with ideas of self-generative, autonomous, (creative?) influence\nand activity. Autoshop is capable of being both a tool for generating\ndigital images under (variable) human control, and a play-pen\nfor artificial/digital lifeforms, A.I. bots, and pseudo-chaos\nsystems. The output is entertaining, startling and thoroughly\nusable.\"",
      "links": []
    },
